<title>USA: Wheat First wins Virginia $50 mln housing revs.</title>
<headline>Wheat First wins Virginia $50 mln housing revs.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wheat First Butcher Singer said it won $50 million of Virginia Housing Development Authority taxable mortgage bonds with a true interest cost (TIC) of 7.727 percent.</p>
</text>
